          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "investieren goes back to Latin investīre \"to clothe, to cover\" (Lewis & Short), built on vestis \"garment\"; the money sense is usually said to have come later, through Italian investire."
            }
          ]
        },
